# Generated build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vs/

# Compiled binaries
**/*.dll
**/*.exe
**/*.pdb
**/*.nupkg
**/*.cache
**/*.user

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

# Package managers
**/node_modules/

# Large data / datasets
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.7z
**/*.bak
# No *.csv rule: CsvTranslations/translations.csv and the per-app csv_files/ corpora are
# tracked, deliberate content - ignoring them would hide the dictionary from the assistant.

# IDE metadata
**/.idea/
**/*.suo
